een carefully illustrated by a talented artist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Person -</strong> The first person perspective creates a unique sense of immersion. Explore the ruins of the temple where every detail has been carefully placed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living world -</strong> Expand your Order at the foot of the fortress. Watch your armies take position for the final battle and witness the epic assaults led by the mighty Lords of the Inquisition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Message from the developer:</strong></i><br><i>Thank you to every player who has added the game to their wishlist, left a review on the demo page, sent a message, or shown support in any way. As a solo developer, this means an incredible amount to me and greatly helps me deliver the best possible experience. THANK YOU.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Knightstones is a first person roguelite auto battler that blends turn based planning, real time battles, and resource management, all within a unique visual style.</strong><br><strong>Many challenges await you in the campaign against the Third Inquisition.</strong><br><strong>Fulfill your duty, or perish trying.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Lead your troops on your war table in this unique roguelite auto-battler. Deploy your decks of elite warriors, trigger devastating chain reactions, and invest your rewards to rebuild your fallen Order. Be ready… or perish in the final battle.", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/808392d0a7a81877ccec6bb246869a6319137f86/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1787248646", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/e6114ad5c204fe6bba95